The Divine Amphora is a boon of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] that lets its bearer move divine energy between vessels. The bearer can take divine energy from a willing source, and can give divine energy to a source whether it is willing or not. What is taken counts as the bearer's own.

It came to [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] when [[Divinity/Immix|Immix]] died: the released divinity poured into his chest and left him feeling only that he could hold more. With it he can draw the divine energy out of a person's blood, which cures the [[Phenomena/Althane/Wasting Fever|wasting fever]], and he believes he can charge a divine battery by the same means.
